   "locked": false,
   "text": "on('session.start')\n• registers the /she slash command\n• fire-and-forget: $.process.run(['she', '--\n  warm']) with a 120 s limit; session start is\n  never held\n• `she` missing → notice + toast",
   "originalText": "on('session.start')\n• registers the /she slash command\n• fire-and-forget: $.process.run(['she', '--\n  warm']) with a 120 s limit; session start is\n  never held\n• `she` missing → notice + toast",
