   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "she --warm\n1. ensure_running: GET /api/version; if down\n  and local → Popen `ollama serve` with\n  OLLAMA_HOST=host:port (detached); pid file =\n  pid + URL\n2. model_digest: GET /api/tags\n3. warm: POST /api/generate (empty prompt,\n  keep_alive)\nURL: $SHE_OLLAMA_URL, else\n127.0.0.1:$SHE_OLLAMA_PORT (11435); a remote\nserver is never started",
   "originalText": "she --warm\n1. ensure_running: GET /api/version; if down\n  and local → Popen `ollama serve` with\n  OLLAMA_HOST=host:port (detached); pid file =\n  pid + URL\n2. model_digest: GET /api/tags\n3. warm: POST /api/generate (empty prompt,\n  keep_alive)\nURL: $SHE_OLLAMA_URL, else\n127.0.0.1:$SHE_OLLAMA_PORT (11435); a remote\nserver is never started",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "S1",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
