   "text": "explain(id, command)\n• upsert into `explanations` atom (keeps last\n  5)\n• gist[id] = 'explaining…'\n• open the 'she' pane\n• $.process.spawn(['she', '--json-stream',\n  '--', command])\n  argv list, never a shell string; killed\n  after 90 s",
   "originalText": "explain(id, command)\n• upsert into `explanations` atom (keeps last\n  5)\n• gist[id] = 'explaining…'\n• open the 'she' pane\n• $.process.spawn(['she', '--json-stream',\n  '--', command])\n  argv list, never a shell string; killed\n  after 90 s",
