   "text": "Deterministic layer (no LLM, never runs the\ncommand)\n• tree-sitter bash parse\n• local man pages\n• learned --help pages (probes under sandbox-\n  exec)\n→ stdout: {event: 'deterministic', breakdown,\n  files, env, unknowns}",
   "originalText": "Deterministic layer (no LLM, never runs the\ncommand)\n• tree-sitter bash parse\n• local man pages\n• learned --help pages (probes under sandbox-\n  exec)\n→ stdout: {event: 'deterministic', breakdown,\n  files, env, unknowns}",
